        "verse": 10
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "ISA",
          "chapter": 57,
          "verse": 10
        }
      ],
      "en": "You were wearied with the length of your ways; yet you didn’t say, ‘It is in vain.’ You found a reviving of your strength; therefore you weren’t faint.",
      "ko": "네가 길이 멀어서 피곤할찌라도 헛되다 아니함은 네 힘이 소성되었으므로 쇠약하여 가지 아니함이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "203ea25dc2c437c38aeeddc1fc351676b9985f35ef51ce8d0bb30f7d113b992b",
      "translation_text_hash": "dd1d9c00c961034a6c2e5b3c54ab742ee22773860a2c0478bd1a8eece9100bf6",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
