      "en": "I was angry because of the iniquity of his covetousness and struck him. I hid myself and was angry; and he went on backsliding in the way of his heart.",
      "ko": "그의 탐심의 죄악을 인하여 내가 노하여 그를 쳤으며 또 내 얼굴을 가리우고 노하였으나 그가 오히려 패역하여 자기 마음의 길로 행하도다",
      "source_text_hash": "cbf91a24092db3dbafaa50e24d93fa0fd16137b72a8e06ac5a058d8c5cc4604d",
